r PLC in Atascosa County","/arc-plc/texas/atascosa-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and June to July, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 33% of normal in October to November and 23% in November to December. So far in 2026 it has gone the other way, with April to May at 174% and May to June at 176% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
